  "shared_implementation": "One editor application callback validates immutable AnalysisResult through the original ProjectLanguageService and shared LanguageService facade; both authenticated native adapters use that same workflow.",
  "contract": [
    "Retain the actual selected service, document/client, full effective editor source revision, query, context and normalized result for edit-producing replies. Read-only/list replies do not retain an extra body copy.",
    "Formatting and resolved completion reject changed payloads before authority. Await original-service validation before synchronous editor-history publication, without overlay synchronization, an LSP request or a replacement process.",
    "Guard the retained result identity, source inventory, account/provider and selection around validation. Abort superseded applications; request tickets prevent old background responses resetting a newer operation.",
    "Automatic completion retains its popup during validation and on failure, supports retry, and closes it only after successful publication. Preserve snippets, undo and the existing unsaved baseline.",
    "Background diagnostic replies do not replace the provider identity of an already displayed action."
  ],
  "coverage": [
    "Four new optimized Chrome contracts execute through the installed controller and shared facade in Local and Remote modes.",
    "Formatting payload tampering rejects before native authority; native dependency rejection preserves the draft, retry succeeds and undo preserves its real unsaved baseline. Missing context rejects application.",
    "Resolved completion waits for a held validation, rejects modified items, publishes snippets with selected fields and remains undoable.",
    "Late validation after another retained draft, selection, dismissal, provider, account generation or result replacement cannot publish; a fresh replacement remains applicable.",
    "Automatic Suggest/Resolve completion retains its popup until validation, preserves failure and retries successfully.",
    "Full affected language_plugins and local_bridge component suites, frontend native tests and strict all-target WASM frontend Clippy pass on the same source."
  ],
